Global Payments/Genius sales deck slide titled “Powering innovation” and labeled “Client success stories.” The slide lists Cloud POS; indoor and outdoor kiosks; drive-thru digital menu boards; integrated unified commerce platform. It includes a quote attributed to Josh Wesolowski, Director, Digital Product and Experience, CosMc's: “CosMc’s undertook a comprehensive process when choosing Global Payments to enable our unique new concept. The breadth and depth of their solutions allowed us to pick a single supplier and enabled us to move faster, unlocking our speed to market.”